<title>UK: Halifax to make statement on rates soon.</title>
<headline>Halifax to make statement on rates soon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Halifax Building Society said on Tuesday it would make a statement on mortgate rates soon in response to an increase in UK interest rates to 6.25 percent from 6.0.  </p>
<p>A spokeswoman for the Halifax said the building society expected to issue a statement in about half an hour.</p>
<p>Britain's new Labour government, which won a landslide victory at last week's election, set the increase in rates.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
